{"id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-substitution.md","title":"Substitution","display":"df-substitution — Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-substitution","aliases":["92-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — Substitution","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 16、18–19（PDF 33、35–36）","source_status":"本地一般无捕获项代入"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 16、18–19（PDF 33、35–36）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地一般无捕获项代入"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-substitution-—-Substitution-$\\varphit/x$\">df-substitution — Substitution <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,u,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(s,u,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (clause metavariables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\mathrm{fresh}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\mathrm{fresh}_G\\)</span> (definition-target functions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\mathrm{Subst}_G:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(x,t,x)=t,\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(y,t,x)=y\\ (y\\neq x),\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(0,t,x)=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(S(s),t,x)=S(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s\\circ u,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\cdot\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(s=u,t,x)=\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\neg\\varphi,t,x)=\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi,t,x)=\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qx\\,\\varphi\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb{N}\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;z_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qy\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qz_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\,\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,z_{\\varphi,t,x,y},y),t,x\\bigr)\n\\quad(y\\neq x,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\mathrm{Subst}_G:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(x,t,x)=t,\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(y,t,x)=y\\ (y\\neq x),\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(0,t,x)=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(S(s),t,x)=S(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s\\circ u,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\cdot\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(s=u,t,x)=\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\neg\\varphi,t,x)=\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi,t,x)=\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qx\\,\\varphi\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb{N}\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;z_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qy\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qz_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\,\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,z_{\\varphi,t,x,y},y),t,x\\bigr)\n\\quad(y\\neq x,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> : 将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>的自由出现替换为项<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> : 自由变量函数</li>\n<li>替换只对自由变量进行</li>\n<li>新变量从不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,t,x,y\">\\(\\varphi,t,x,y\\)</span> 的相关自由变量集合中；该集合有限而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> 无限，所以最小可用下标存在</li>\n<li>量词分支先作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名，再继续代入，因而不会捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的自由变量</li>\n<li>对角化引理使用替换操作构造自引用句子</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书先定义闭数码代入，随后定义变量改名；它的量词包裹 F[n] 刻意避免算术化一般代入。本文给更一般的 G 项代入。原书数码实例见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bd6b982556489ede\" href=\"?note=bd6b982556489ede\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution\">92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</a>；包裹见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a>。</p>\n<p>递归以公式的逻辑度（联结词和量词节点数）良基化。量词分支的内部改名调用作用于低一度的矩阵；变量改名保持逻辑度，随后第二次调用仍作用于该低度公式。项代入按项树高度递归。对逻辑度和项树高度归纳可得存在、唯一、保持良构以及自由变量不被捕获；不能以改名后的字符长度严格缩短作为理由。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-substitution-—-Substitution-$\\varphit/x$","text":"df-substitution — Substitution $\\varphi[t/x]$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书先定义闭数码代入，随后定义变量改名；它的量词包裹 F[n] 刻意避免算术化一般代入。本文给更一般的 G 项代入。原书数码实例见 [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]；包裹见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书先定义闭数码代入，随后定义变量改名；它的量词包裹 F[n] 刻意避免算术化一般代入。本文给更一般的 G 项代入。原书数码实例见 [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]；包裹见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"s,u,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\mathrm{fresh}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\mathrm{Subst}_G:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(x,t,x)=t,\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(y,t,x)=y\\ (y\\neq x),\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(0,t,x)=0,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(S(s),t,x)=S(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s\\circ u,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\cdot\\}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Subst}_G(s=u,t,x)=\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\neg\\varphi,t,x)=\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi,t,x)=\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qx\\,\\varphi\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb{N}\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}},\\\\\n&z_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qy\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qz_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\,\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,z_{\\varphi,t,x,y},y),t,x\\bigr)\n\\quad(y\\neq x,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,t,x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":3428,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28281ca315fc78c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d5d7c9d78e08590","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subst}_G$ (capture-avoiding substitution, see [[92-df-substitution]])"},{"id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-6"