thrm{Prov}_G(v_0)$ 再作 $\\mathrm{Subst}_G$，与直接构造 $\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\bar n)$，可能采用不同绑定变量名。由[[92-df-formula-instance]]及[[92-df-substitution]]，两者仅保证 $\\alpha$ 等价，并可由一阶逻辑证明双条件；把该双条件与对角引理的双条件组合后才得到相应固定点谓词。这里未把不同字符串或它们的 Gödel 码当成字面相等。"},{"id":"dc82a379ef71435e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ced07f0d506d2066","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"916836dbb5b34f34","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eba4d14b343d9469","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07afadb094119590","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subst}_G$ (capture-avoiding syntactic substitution, see [[92-df-substitution]])"},{"id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"88eede408dae828a","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)$把“把句子码代入$T$的自由变量”写成[[92-df-substitution]]中的三元无捕获代入；公式$T$不能被当作元语言函数直接应用"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["4ef6f65f207e8439","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","bd6b982556489ede","6deaff22ee062525"]}